$DATUM 2.14. Synthesis of Compound 10 To a THF solution (10 mL) of a mixture of
8 (100 mg, 0.081 mmol) and 5-dodecylthienyl-2-boronic acid (S6) (145 mg,
0.488 mmol) were successively added Pd(PPh3)4 (10 mg, 9 μmol) and 4 M
aqueous NaOH (1 mL), and the mixture was refluxed for 12 h under Ar.
Then, the reaction mixture was poured into aqueous NH4Cl, and an aqueous
layer separated was extracted with CH2Cl2. An organic extract was washed
with brine, dried over Na2SO4, and evaporated to dryness under reduced
pressure, and the residue was subjected to flash column chromatography on
silica gel using hexane as an eluent. Isolation of 10 as colorless oily
liquid (113 mg, 0.065 mmol, 79%). 1H NMR (CDCl3) δ 7.43 (s, 3H, Ar-H),
6.92 (m, 6H, Ar-H), 6.65 (d, J = 2 Hz, 3H, Ar-H), 2.73-2.80 (m, 12H,
CH2), 1.71 (t, 6H, J = 7.0 Hz, CH2), 1.64 (t, 6H, J = 7.5 Hz, CH2),
1.21-1.43 (m, 108H, CH2), 0.86-0.89 (m, 18H, CH3); 13C NMR (CDCl3) δ
147.5, 144.8, 137.3, 132.2, 131.4, 131.2, 130.7, 130.5, 127.6, 126.7,
124.2, 120.9, 31.9, 31.6, 31.4, 30.3, 30.2, 30.1, 29.7, 29.6, 29.6, 29.5,
29.4, 29.3, 29.2, 29.1, 22.7, 14.1; MALDI-TOF MS m/z calcd. for
C108H162S9 1747.0, found 1748.7.
