$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
5-[6-Amino-5-[(1R)-1-(2,6-dichloro-3-fluorophenyl)ethoxy]-3-pyridyl]-1'-methylspiro[indoline-3,4'-piperidine]-2-one
(5a) To a mixture of
5-bromo-3-[(1R)-1-(2,6-dichloro-3-fluorophenyl)ethoxy]-2-aminopyridine1
(10a, 75.8 mg, 0.2 mmol),
1'-methyl-5-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)spiro[indoline-
3,4'-piperidine]-2-one2 (11m, 82 mg, 0.24 mmol), and potassium carbonate
(82.9 mg, 0.6 mmol) in DME/water (4/1, 2.0 ml) was added Pd(PPh3)4 (11.6
mg, 0.01 mmol). The resulting mixture was bubbled into nitrogen for 2
min, then stirred at 80ºC for 18 h. LC-MS showed the reaction was
complete. After cooled down to room temperature, the mixture was diluted
with water (5 mL) and extracted with DCM (3 × 10 mL). The organic phases
were combined, dried (Na2SO4), and concentrated to give the crude
product, which was purified by silica gel column chromatography eluted
with 7 M ammonia in methanol/DCM (5/95).
6-[6-Amino-5-[(2,6-dichloro-3-fluorophenyl)methoxy]-3-pyridyl]-1'-methylspiro[indoline-3,4'-piperidine]-2-one
(7b) Yield: 78%. 1H-NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz): δ (ppm) 1.96-2.00 (m, 2 H),
2.01-2.12 (m, 2 H), 2.46 (s, 3 H), 2.66-2.73 (m, 2 H), 2.90-2.96 (m, 2
H), 5.30 (s, br, 2 H), 6.94-7.01 (m, 3 H), 7.07 (t, J = 8.4 Hz, 1 H),
7.30 (m, 1 H), 7.34 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 7.89 (d, J = 2.0 Hz, 1 H), 8.56
(s, br, 1 H). MS: m/z (ESI+) 501.06 [M+H+, 35Cl, 35Cl], 503.04 [M+H+,
35Cl, 37Cl]. Anal. Calcd. for C25H23Cl2FN4O2.0.33H2O: C, 59.18; H, 4.70;
N, 11.04; Cl, 13.97; F, 3.74. Found: C, 58.95; H, 4.86; N, 11.32; Cl,
14.07; F, 3.64.
