$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Isolation of
{[Ph2C(Cp)(2,7-tBu2-Flu)]Zr(THF)[OC(OiPr)=CMe2]}+[MeB(C6F5)3]-{6a+[MeB(C6F5)3]-}.
The same procedure described for the synthesis of the parent complex
[Ph2C(Cp)(Flu)]ZrMe[OC(OiPr)=CMe2]12 was followed for the synthesis of
[Ph2C(Cp)(2,7-tBu2- Flu)]ZrMe[OC(OiPr)=CMe2]. Next, in an argon-filled
glovebox, a 20-mL glass vial was charged with the neutral mono(ester
enolate) complex (119.2 mg, 0.16 mmol) and 4 mL hexanes, while another
vial was charged with THF•B(C6F5)3 (93.8 mg, 0.16 mmol) and 4 mL toluene.
The two vials were mixed via pipette at ambient temperature to give
instantaneously a yellow solution and a red oil at the bottom. The clear
solution was decanted and the red oil was washed by hexanes (3×5mL). The
hexanes were decanted and 165 mg (77.5 %) complex 6a+[MeB(C6F5)3]- was
obtained as a red solid after drying under vacuum.
{[Ph2C(Cp)(2,7-tBu2-Flu)]Zr(THF)[OC(OiPr)=CMe2]}+[MeB(C6F5)3]-{6a+[MeB(C6F5)3]-},
yield 77.5%, 165 mg 1H NMR (C6D6, 23°C) for
[Ph2C(Cp)(2,7-tBu2-Flu)]ZrMe2: δ 8.03 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 2H, Flu), 7.88 (d,
J = 7.6 Hz, 2H, Ph), 7.68 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 2H, Ph), 7.46 (d, J = 8.4 Hz,
2H, Flu), 7.12 (t, J = 7.4 Hz, 2H, Ph), 7.04 (t, J = 7.6 Hz, 2H, Ph),
6.93 (t, J = 7.4 Hz, 2H, Ph), 6.41 (s, 2H, Flu), 6.19 (t, J = 2.6 Hz, 2H,
Cp), 5.59 (t, J = 2.6 Hz, 2H, Cp), 1.10 (s, 18H, tBu), -1.16 (s, 6H,
ZrMe2). 1H NMR (C6D6, 23°C) for [Ph2C(Cp)(2,7-tBu2-Flu)]ZrMe(OTf): δ 7.99
(d, J = 8.8 Hz, 1H, Flu), 7.79 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 1H, Flu), 7.71 (d, J = 8.0
Hz, 1H, Ph), 7.60 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 1H, Ph), 7.59 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 1H, Ph),
7.53 (dd, 3J = 8.8 Hz, 4J = 1.2 Hz, 1H, Flu), 7.50 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 1H,
Ph), 7.44 (dd, 3J = 8.8 Hz, 4J = 1.6 Hz, 1H, Flu), 7.14-6.90 (m, 6H, Ph),
6.50 (s, 1H, Flu), 6.29 (m, 1H, Cp), 6.24 (s, 1H, Flu), 6.22 (m, 1H, Cp),
5.89 (m, 1H, Cp), 5.24 (m, 1H, Cp), 1.19 (s, 9H, tBu), 0.98 (s, 9H, tBu),
-0.77 (s, 3H, Zr-Me). 19F NMR (C6D6, 23°C): δ -158.4 (s, 3F, C-F). 1H NMR
(C6D6, 23°C) for [Ph2C(Cp)(2,7- tBu2-Flu)]ZrMe[OC(OiPr)=CMe2]: δ 8.05 (d,
J = 8.7 Hz, 1H, Flu), 8.04 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 1H, Flu), 7.99 (d, J = 7.8 Hz,
1H, Ph), 7.84 (d, J = 7.8 Hz, 1H, Ph), 7.67 (d, J = 8.1 Hz, 1H, Ph), 7.60
(d, J = 8.1 Hz, 1H, Ph), 7.49 (dd, 3J = 8.7 Hz, 4J = 1.5 Hz, 1H, Flu),
7.31 (dd, 3J = 8.7 Hz, 4J = 1.5 Hz, 1H, Flu), 7.20-6.90 (m, 6H, Ph), 6.77
(s, 1H, Flu), 6.48 (d, J = 1.2 Hz, 1H, Flu), 6.25 (m, 1H, Cp), 6.14 (m,
1H, Cp), 5.78 (m, 1H, Cp), 5.64 (m, 1H, Cp), 3.92 (sept, J = 6.2 Hz, 1H,
CHMe2), 1.70 (s, 3H, =CMe), 1.38 (s, 3H, =CMe), 1.19 (s, 9H, tBu), 1.15
(s, 9H, tBu), 1.06 (d, J = 6.3 Hz, 6H, CHMe2), -0.93 (s, 3H, Zr-Me).
